{
  "_readme": "CCB Form Test Mode dry-run. Run:  node test-form-test-mode.js test-cases.json   (add --calls to see every stubbed call). Nothing is sent or written - the network is fully stubbed and every address below is fake. Recipient lists are different per form on purpose, so a mis-routed email shows up. writePaths = Breeze does its writes as GET requests, so these URL fragments are classified as writes.",
  "testAddress": "tester@example.test",
